{
  "_comment": [
    "Every settable key in the shipped config.yml, and how it is covered.",
    "",
    "A key here with a 'case' has an acceptance test driving it. A key with",
    "'pending' does not yet, and says why. A key in NEITHER is a build failure:",
    "that is the point, so a setting added later cannot ship untested.",
    "",
    "A key with 'limited' is driven, but the harness cannot reach the whole of",
    "what it does -- a kick needs a connected client, a Bedrock flag needs",
    "Floodgate. Those cases report and ask for a person rather than claiming a",
    "pass they did not earn.",
    "",
    "Generated once from config.yml; maintained by hand thereafter."
  ],
